     2  1  1              NCL, IPAL, IBARLAB (see below)
   0     255  255  255     1.00000   1.00000   1.00000   background
   0       0    0    0     0.00000   0.00000   0.00000   foreground
   1     240  240  240     0.00000   0.12549   1.00000
   2     168  168  168     0.00000   1.00000   1.00000
   0      64   30    0     0.25098   0.11765   0.00000   land color
   0     255  255  255     0.75509   0.87843   1.00000   water color
   0     150  204  204     0.58824   0.80000   0.80000   polyline overlay color

 Color    iR   iG   iB        R         G         B


